<title> Patient with Suspected Rhabdomyolysis: Evaluation.</title>
<graphic href="eee0405-w0001.gif" />
<cell type="start" id="cell-1">
<label>Suspected rhabdomyolysis. Serum CK &#x003E;5x normal?</label>
<path target="cell-3">Yes</path>
<path target="cell-2">No</path>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-2">
<label>Urine myoglobin present?</label>
<path target="cell-3">Yes</path>
<path target="cell-4">No</path>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-4">
<label>Rhabdomyolysis unlikely.</label>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-3">
<label>Rhabdomyolysis.</label>
<path target="cell-5"></path>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-5">
<label>IV hydration to ensure urine output &#x003E;250 cc&#x002F;h.</label>
<path target="cell-6"></path>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-6">
<label>Compartment syndrome?</label>
<path target="cell-9">Yes</path>
<path target="cell-7">No</path>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-7">
<label>Renal failure?</label>
<path target="cell-10">Yes</path>
<path target="cell-8">No</path>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-8">
<label>Electrolyte abnormalities?</label>
<path target="cell-11">Yes</path>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-9">
<label>Orthopedic consult.</label>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-10">
<label>Nephrology consult.</label>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-11">
<label>Carefully correct any electrolyte abnormalities.</label>
</cell>
